      Entry: 1
      Data: Cornelius6
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: I can only draw one conclusion from this series of events. This <style=Engine>sky
        engine</style> appears to have intertwined our shared survival. Will you
        join me in saving <style=location>Hammerstead</style> and all that exists
        around it?
    - Name: <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
    - Name: <Choices>k__BackingField
